cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or these tools, please cite this repository."
title: "Wayland Desktop Audit: measured install cost and dependency closures for Arch Linux desktop stacks"
abstract: >-
  Dependency-closure measurements for nine Wayland compositor + shell + theme-engine
  stacks on Arch Linux, plus source-level audits of three community builds (impasto,
  wayle, rust-dock). Reports installed size and package count resolved offline from the
  official Arch repositories, with a provenance chain recorded for every package that
  enters a closure.
authors:
